DTEND:20261018T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20261018T180000Z
UID:knIVmA6eCc
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nCommunity ScreeningsAmerican exp
 at Rick Blaine (Humphrey Bogart) runs a Moroccan nightclub during World Wa
 r II and contends with his ex (Ingrid Bergman)\, who walks back into his l
 ife.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/community-screenings/casa
 blanca\n\nEstimated start: 11:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
